# Manifold level 10
# The fortress's keep (stage 5f): the third level, the flame. Its hall, dark; at its end, the flame on
# a pedestal, and a guard at its post watching it, its back to the hall (a blow from behind). The flame
# taken is carried lit: it shows whoever carries it. Out by a side door to a passage, where a guard
# keeps its round, to a postern near its south end.
title The keep
spawn 0 1 7
facing 0 0 -1
ambient 0.12
sky 22.0

# The ground; and outside the postern, a landing.
kit floor_4  -8 0 -34
kit floor_4  -4 0 -34
